WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:01.810
Hey Thoughty2 here.

00:00:01.810 --> 00:00:07.319
Ah, the Koala bear, such adorable little balls
of fluffy stupidity.

00:00:07.319 --> 00:00:12.320
Don't let its suave looks and longing beady
eyes fool you into thinking that it's up to

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:13.320
something.

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:17.500
There really is, absolutely nothing, going
on in there.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:23.260
Scientists have discovered that the beloved
koala bear may be the least intelligent mammal

00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:24.610
on the planet.

00:00:24.610 --> 00:00:25.840
Don't believe me?

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:26.840
Look!

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:28.610
This one's trying to climb a bloody painting.

00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:31.560
"Oh you guys saw that did you".

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:38.879
They may have large fluffy heads, but a koala
brain is tiny, making up just 2% of its body

00:00:38.879 --> 00:00:43.850
weight, the smallest brain to body-size ratio
of any mammal.

00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:49.019
They also have a smooth brain which is evolutionary
language for "they're about a million years

00:00:49.019 --> 00:00:51.079
late to the party".

00:00:51.079 --> 00:00:56.719
Koalas are so stupid that if you take a few
eucalyptus leaves and put them on a plate

00:00:56.719 --> 00:00:59.729
in front of a koala it won't eat them.

00:00:59.729 --> 00:01:04.610
Because it thinks that if it's not attached
to a tree then it can't possibly be food.

00:01:04.610 --> 00:01:11.119
But not only are they stupid, koala bears
generally make terrible animals, they're just

00:01:11.119 --> 00:01:12.750
put together all wrong.

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:18.140
Their favourite food is so inadequate that
they have to move really slowly to preserve

00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:19.600
energy.

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:24.649
Eucalyptus leaves are ridiculously low in
nutrients and calories, they need to eat 2,000

00:01:24.649 --> 00:01:26.820
leaves a day to survive.

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:31.539
It's like us humans living entirely off celery,
okay your friend at work may have tried that

00:01:31.539 --> 00:01:35.200
diet for a month, but eventually it's gonna
end badly -&nbsp;

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:38.340
Eucalyptus truly is a terrible food.

00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:44.210
It's not even food, eucalyptus leaves do everything
they can to make it perfectly clear that they

00:01:44.210 --> 00:01:46.649
do not want to be eaten.

00:01:46.649 --> 00:01:52.180
Not only are they practically inedible, they're
chewier and tougher than your grandma's pork

00:01:52.180 --> 00:01:53.180
chops.

00:01:53.180 --> 00:01:54.789
But they are also poisonous.

00:01:54.789 --> 00:02:01.880
But koalas were like "listen boys, we've got
this" and dedicated their entire evolutionary

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:08.430
history to adapting themselves to be able
to digest this toxic plant and not dying afterwards.

00:02:08.430 --> 00:02:14.220
When they could have eaten literally any other
food and done considerably better at being

00:02:14.220 --> 00:02:15.220
animals.

00:02:15.220 --> 00:02:19.610
They get so little energy in fact that they
need to sleep 18 hours a day.

00:02:19.610 --> 00:02:25.390
But they're too darn intellectually-deficient
to find another food to eat.

00:02:25.390 --> 00:02:31.190
Eucalyptus is so difficult to digest that
it takes four whole days and only adult koalas

00:02:31.190 --> 00:02:34.900
have sufficiently developed digestive systems
to cope with it.

00:02:34.900 --> 00:02:44.930
Baby koalas can't digest the leaves at all,
so they eat their own mother's feces, known

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:48.430
as "fecal pap" to survive.

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:55.830
Not only that, but they use their claws to
scrape the poop dinner out their mother's

00:02:55.830 --> 00:02:56.830
anus.

00:02:56.830 --> 00:03:02.780
They may look docile but get on the wrong
side of these moronic poop-eating furballs

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:05.510
and you'll regret it, in fights they go full-psycho.

00:03:05.510 --> 00:03:11.750
Yet, despite their occasional hissy fit, the
koala bear has been named by one animal conservationist

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:14.690
as "the most boring of all animals".

00:03:14.690 --> 00:03:17.130
Poor little guys.

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:22.310
And if after all that, you still need more
proof that koalas really are the most pathetic

00:03:22.310 --> 00:03:30.540
and unfortunate animal - about 90% of all
koalas have chlamydia, which makes them incontinent,

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:32.650
so they spend all day pissing themselves.

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:38.230
And if you thought this cuddly little misfit
couldn't get any weirder... this is what they

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:46.370
sound like.

00:03:46.370 --> 00:04:07.650
Yeah.. thanks for watching.

